u0abe)',dateIso:'2026-06-14',category:'CULTURAL',deity:'Bhudevi (Mother Earth)',description:'Unique 3-day festival of Odisha celebrating womanhood and the rejuvenation of Mother Earth.',rituals:'Swinging on decorated rope swings (Dolikas), eating Poda Pitha, no plowing or digging Earth.',tithiDescription:'Mithuna Sankranti',region:'Odisha',isHoliday:!0},{id:'f_mh_bail_pola',name:'\ud83d\udc02 Bail Pola (Maharashtra Bull & Cattle Worship)',hindiName:'\ud83d\udc02 \u092c\u0948\u0932 \u092a\u094b\u0932\u093e (\u092e\u0939\u093e\u0930\u093e\u0937\u094d\u091f\u094d\u0930 \u090f\u0935\u0902 \u091b\u0924\u094d\u0924\u0940\u0938\u0917\u0922\u093c)',gujaratiName:'\ud83d\udc02 \u0aac\u0ab3\u0aa6 \u0aaa\u0acb\u0ab3\u0abe (\u0aae\u0ab9\u0abe\u0ab0\u0abe\u0ab7\u0acd\u0a9f\u0acd\u0ab0)',dateIso:'2026-09-10',category:'CULTURAL',deity:'Nandi Dev & Cattle',description:'Traditional thanksgiving festival celebrated by farmers in Maharashtra & Chhattisgarh honoring bulls & oxen.',rituals:'Washing, decorating bulls with horns painted, colorful shawls, and grand procession.',tithiDescription:'Shravana Amavasya (Pithori Amavasya)',region:'Maharashtra & Chhattisgarh',isHoliday:!1},{id:'f_mh_narali_purnima',name:'\ud83e\udd65 Narali Purnima (Maharashtra Coconut Festival)',hindiName:'\ud83e\udd65 \u0928\u093e\u0930\u0932\u0940 \u092a\u0942\u0930\u094d\u0923\u093f\u092e\u093e (\u092e\u0939\u093e\u0930\u093e\u0937\u094d\u091f\u094d\u0930 \u0938\u092e\u0941\u0926\u094d\u0930 \u092a\u0942\u091c\u093e)',gujaratiName:'\ud83e\udd65 \u0aa8\u0abe\u0ab0\u0ab3\u0ac0 \u0aaa\u0ac2\u0aa8\u0aae (\u0aae\u0ab9\u0abe\u0ab0\u0abe\u0ab7\u0acd\u0a9f\u0acd\u0ab0)',dateIso:'2026-08-28',category:'CULTURAL',deity:'Varuna Dev (Ocean God)',description:'Fisherfolk community festival of coastal Maharashtra & Goa offering coconuts to the Arabian Sea.',rituals:'Offering gilded coconuts to Sea God Varuna, preparing Narali Bhat (sweet coconut rice).',tithiDescription:'Shravana Purnima',region:'Maharashtra & Goa',isHoliday:!